---
import PatternsExplorer from '../islands/PatternsExplorer';
---

<section id="patterns" aria-labelledby="patterns-h" class="border-b border-line bg-bg">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:py-28">
    <h2 id="patterns-h" class="font-display text-3xl leading-[1.2] font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
      检测 37 种烧额度模式
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-[52ch] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted">
      按类别切换，每个模式都附改前与改后的真实对比。
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10">
      <PatternsExplorer client:visible />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
